@startuml sequence_review_delta
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Outstanding Todos - Review with delta-vs-today

actor User
participant "Scrubber" as Sc
participant "TileContext" as Ctx
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C
participant "API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

User -> Sc: Pick 2026-04-15
Sc -> Ctx: selectedReviewDate
Ctx -> T: signal change
T -> C: load('review', '<date>')
C -> API: GET /todos/outstanding-count?asOf=<date>&includeToday=true
API -> API: clamp asOf
API -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) outstanding at asOf
DB --> API: 6
API -> DB: SELECT COUNT(*) outstanding at UtcNow
DB --> API: 4
API --> C: { count: 6, todayCount: 4 } + Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
C --> T: signals (count=6, deltaLabel='-2 vs today', deltaTone='success')
T --> User: 6 with REVIEW pill, delta badge "-2 vs today" (green)

@enduml
